  lines:
  - Duchamp? Are you there?
  - "Yes, hello? It was just here, it\u2019s coming to get me."
  - "Don\u2019t worry, I\u2019ve lured it to the ravine with music thanks to your
    notes."
  - "I\u2019m sending a rescue team to your location."
  - Thank you so much. Are the others safe?
  - "Unfortunately, it was too late for captain Sharp, but we\u2019ve got everyone
    else."
  - Ellie...
  - Ok. Please hurry.
  - Time to contact the Team.
